MAIN
MOVE TEMP 11 4
MOVE TEMP 12 HALLOCATE TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 A_fun
HSTORE TEMP 8 0 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 TEMP 8
HSTORE TEMP 7 0 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 7
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 6 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 0
MOVE TEMP 17 CALL TEMP 10 ( TEMP 6 )
PRINT TEMP 17
END
A_fun [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 18 20
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 10
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 20 MINUS TEMP 2 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 21 4
MOVE TEMP 22 TIMES TEMP 2 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 22
MOVE TEMP 23 LE TEMP 4 TEMP 1
CJUMP TEMP 23 L0
MOVE TEMP 24 PLUS TEMP 4 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 24
JUMP L1
L0 MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 1
L1  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 5
END

